      <h3>LinkedIn — 12 Posts</h3>

      <div class="hub-post no-break">
        <h4>Post 1: The Witness Problem</h4>
        <div class="hub-post-body">I walked past 8 retail stores this morning. Every window had a CCTV sticker. Not a single one had a guard watching the feed.
We call them "security cameras," but most are just witnesses that arrive too late. They record the crime so you can file the report. They do not stop the loss.
Real security is not storage. It is speed. 0.4-second alert speed. Edge-AI speed. The kind that pings your phone before the shoplifter reaches the exit.
If your system cannot tell you what is happening while it is happening, you own an evidence locker, not a security system.
<span class="hub-cta">14-day free trial. No card. Comment "GUARD" and we'll send the setup checklist.</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-post no-break">
        <h4>Post 2: The 13-Second Rule</h4>
        <div class="hub-post-body">The average shoplifter needs 13 seconds to conceal an item. The average store manager reviews CCTV footage the next morning.
By the time you sit down with your coffee and scrub through last night's recordings, the inventory is already on a resale site. Your camera saw it. You didn't.
This is not a staffing problem. It is a systems problem. Human attention fluctuates. Guard shifts end. But edge AI runs at 3 AM, 3 PM, and every second in between.
<span class="hub-cta">How many seconds is your current response time? If it is measured in minutes or hours, we should talk.</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-post no-break">
        <h4>Post 3: Insurance vs Prevention</h4>
        <div class="hub-post-body">Business insurance pays you back after the loss. Prevention pays you by stopping the loss. Which budget feels smarter to you?
One high-ticket shoplifting event in a premium store can exceed S$1,200 (₹70,000). One month of Vantag Starter is S$39 (₹1,999).
If preventing a single theft every 30 months already pays for the entire system, everything after that is pure profit protection.
We equipped a 3-location pharmacy chain with Vantag last quarter. Shrinkage dropped 34% in 60 days. The "cost" of the platform was recovered in Week 2.
<span class="hub-cta">Stop filing claims. Start firing alerts. DM "PHARMACY" for the full case study.</span></div>
