      <div class="hub-post no-break">
        <h4>Post 4: Your Data Doesn't Need a Passport</h4>
        <div class="hub-post-body">If your CCTV sends video to the cloud to "analyse" it, your data just crossed a border you never approved.
Upload. Analyse. Wait. Alert. That pipeline adds 7–15 seconds of latency. It also adds legal complexity, bandwidth costs, and a very real privacy risk.
Vantag runs 11 AI models on a chip inside your store. Your video never leaves the premises. The alert reaches your phone in 0.4 seconds. Not because the cloud is fast, but because the cloud is not involved at all.
That is what "edge" actually means. Not a buzzword. A physical chip, inside your building, doing the work.
<span class="hub-cta">Privacy-conscious operators: let us show you how zero-upload security works.</span></div>
