      <div class="hub-post no-break">
        <h4>Post 5: The Myth of the Smart Camera</h4>
        <div class="hub-post-body">Your Hikvision or Dahua system is not "smart" just because the box says AI. If it cannot distinguish between a stray cat and a crowbar on its own, it is motion detection with marketing.
True AI security distinguishes between:
— Shoplifting behaviour vs. normal browsing
— A fall vs. someone tying a shoelace
— A queue growing vs. a crowd waiting for a bus
It runs 11 distinct models simultaneously and routes alerts to WhatsApp, Slack, or Teams without waking your IT department.
<span class="hub-cta">Tired of false alarms at 2 AM? Try a system built for accuracy, not hype. S$39 / ₹1,999 Starter.</span></div>
